 settings, the forum will shoot you an email every time someone replies and even give part of the post. Most other forums have an option similar to this.<br /> <br /> And while I'd prefer to stay here, if it'd make everyone more comfortable, I'd be happy to move to another forum.<br /> <br /> Finally, if folks were wondering why I haven't posted yet, I had planned on Echo being the last to introduce herself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T21:27:56-08:00","id":322400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stir of Echoes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/288755-ooc-rage-across-the-delaware-valley-werewolf-the-apocalypse?p=322394#post322394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Finally, if folks were wondering why I haven't posted yet, I had planned on Echo being the last to introduce herself.</div> </div> </div> </div>I figured so. Just to know if i didn't make any mistakes : is she in Lupus form right now?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T21:34:46-08:00","id":322403,"title":"","content":"Yes. She's standing back, observing the others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T22:49:54-08:00","id":322429,"title":"","content":"I just hope Echoes and Scott aren't having an impromptu contest to see who introduces themselves last. :-P Do you guys want me to flip a coin?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T22:54:44-08:00","id":322432,"title":"","content":"Only one way to solve the problem:<br /> <br /> Pie-eating contest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions