\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I don't remember saying that, and you can't prove that I did! That's my story and I'm sticking to it!<br /> <br /> But yeah, I will get to it. Next time I have a day off.<br /> <br /> Whenever that is...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T10:59:44-08:00","id":362698,"title":"","content":"Thanks Flo, your description was pretty close to how I imagined the character (although he was wearing a kilt (\u00ac\uff64\u00ac)...ahem)<br /> <br /> Now I just need something Hannah-related and something Scott-related, and my plan will be complete! Muhahaha!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T11:23:26-08:00","id":362745,"title":"","content":"Go for the kilt if you want to!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":""