,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T19:47:23-08:00","id":364034,"title":"","content":"Sorry about that - she's heading to the Piney Sept.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T21:55:26-08:00","id":364094,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stir of Echoes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/288755-ooc-rage-across-the-delaware-valley-werewolf-the-apocalypse?p=364034#post364034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry about that - she's heading to the Piney Sept.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought so, I just wanted to clarify. Just need to wait to see what everyone else is doing before we move on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-09T15:13:53-08:00","id":364815,"title":"","content":"Josh, I'm sorry to ask again, but could you translate your sanskrit? (or hindi, sorry if i'm mistaken). I'd really like to know what Val is saying, even if Geoff doesn't understand. And I can't seem to find a good online translator...<br /> <br /> I figure one of them has to be some sort of interjection, like damn or something.<br /> <br /> Also, i think I've played too much Dragon Age lately, because as soon as I read your post, my first thought was &quot;Val disapproves slightly. -5.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T00:50:27-08:00","id":365196,"title":"","content":"Val's like Morrigan...He disapproves all the time, out of sheer perversity. However, he may react better if you shower him in gifts (hint hint) <br /> <br /> Hayaraba is actually Punjabi (Yeah, I know. Just one of those words you pick up) It is indeed an interjection, and means something like 'dear lord!' Used frequently by despairing grandmothers, women playing matchmaker and...me. Purusham is Hindi for 'men' as in 'male humans'...<br /> <br /> Next week we'll begin conjugating Sanskrit verbs. There'll be a test!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T04:15:42-08:00","id":370892,"title":"","content":"Quiet week. :-o Are we all cool with moving to the sept?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T07:11:48-08:00","id":370991,"title":"","content":"Scott is going to wait for whatever Hannah does, and will go along with her if she follows Echoes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T08:18:32-08:00","id":371051,"title":"","content":"I've been waiting on Mark to post for Hannah. Has anyone heard from him?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"