.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T00:31:51-07:00","id":512693,"title":"","content":"Oh gosh Bashir, that sounds awful! And here I was complaining about my stiff knees...Abrupt change of topic, but listen guys, I have no clue when Jim's coming back, but I was wondering if you were all still in a werewolf mood? I'm quite happy to run a game, I'd welcome the chance in fact. I understand if you don't want to go through the slog of character creation again, but if you're up for it, let me know. It'd be great to play with you guys again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T02:15:47-07:00","id":512749,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'd be up for it. Maybe I'll recreate Geoff for your setting, I'm not sure, or maybe I'll create another Garou, but yeah, that'd be swell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T19:29:54-07:00","id":513609,"title":"","content":"Feel free to just use Geoff, I mean hell, he's your character. It can be like an 'alternate reality' or something. Glad to see you're interested Flo, let's see if anyone else bites, and I'll start setting things up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T23:01:21-07:00","id":513858,"title":"","content":"Sounds tempting...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T23:54:36-07:00","id":513903,"title":"","content":"Count me interested. If I go with Echoes again, I'd like to make a few changes to make her gel better with the group.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars